maluos-gateway (0.3.3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * A request that finds the database but not yet the tenant schema (first
    boot still provisioning) is answered 503 not_ready like a missing
    database, not 500 internal error. Seen when the desktop session
    service called the gateway during first boot (Phase 12 slice 2, UEFI
    boot test).

